  "definition": "Conduct of Representation",
  "effectiveDate": "2008-08-01",
  "historyNote": "#5836, eff 6-15-94; ss by #7302, eff 6-8-00; ss by #9167, INTERIM, eff 6-3-08, EXPIRES: 11-30-08; ss by #9223-A, eff 8-1-08",
